    LLM: "Pass your highest clubs and spades early to avoid being forced to take the Queen or a high-heart trick.\n\nKeep low cards in suits where you have many cards (long suits) to 'slough' your higher penalty cards when others lead that suit.\n\nCounting Spades: Monitor which spades have been played to determine if leading the Queen is safe or if you are about to be 'passed' the Queen.",
